draft-ietf-hpke-pq-05-a5.json
    Appendix A.5 of draft-ietf-hpke-pq-05 (2026-07-06), MLKEM768-X25519 with HKDF-SHA256 and
    ChaCha20Poly1305: https://www.ietf.org/archive/id/draft-ietf-hpke-pq-05.txt

The second file exists because the two drafts define HPKE's DeriveKeyPair differently, and MLS
derives every node key through it. draft-ietf-mls-pq-ciphersuites-07 cites draft-ietf-hpke-pq, whose
SHAKE256.LabeledDerive crypto/hpke implements; the X-Wing draft's §5.6 uses unlabeled SHAKE256.
